/span></span> <span class=\"w mfn-w\" data-g=\"mrifn\">तु</span> '<span class=\"w mfn-w\" data-g=\"mrifn\">अहो</span> <span class=\"w mfn-w\" data-g=\"mrifn\">इति</span> <span class=\"w mfn-w\" data-g=\"mrifn\">विचारणा</span> <span class=\"w mfn-w\" data-g=\"mrifn\"><span class=\"bhsj\">पूर्वं</span><span class=\"bhsp\">पूर्वम्</span></span> <span class=\"w mfn-w\" data-g=\"mrifn\"><span class=\"bhsj\">यस्मादिदमेवेति</span><span class=\"bhsp\">यस्मात् इदम् एव इति</span></span> <span class=\"w mfn-w\" data-g=\"mrifn\">दृश्यते</span> ।</span></div></details></div>","<div class=\"tk-inline mfn-blk\" data-side=\"mrifn\" data-label=\"शास्त्रि-टिप्पणी\"><details class=\"mfn-run\"><summary class=\"mfn-bar\" title=\"शास्त्रि-टिप्पणी — 1 note; click to open or fold\">टिप्पणी · 1</summary><div class=\"mfn-lab\">शास्त्रि-टिप्पणी</div><div class=\"mfn-n\" id=\"mfn-Aitareya-intro-1275-1\"><a class=\"mfn-num\" href=\"#Aitareya:intro:ib2-0\" data-mfb=\"Aitareya:intro:ib2-0\" title=\"back to the word\">भा 1</a><span class=\"mfn-ka\" title=\"Mahesh Research Institute edition (S. Subrahmanya Shastri): page · note\">MRI <span class=\"mfn-kn\">1275·1</span></span> <span class=\"mfn-x\"><span class=\"w mfn-w\" data-g=\"mrifn\"><span class=\"bhsj\">आरण्यकक्रमेण</span><span class=\"bhsp\">आरण्यक-क्रमेण</span></span> <span class=\"w mfn-w\" data-g=\"mrifn\">पूर्वः</span> <span class=\"w mfn-w\" data-g=\"mrifn\"><span class=\"bhsj\">चतुर्थोऽध्यायः</span><span class=\"bhsp\">चतुर्थः अध्यायः</span></span> ।</span></div></details></div>","<div class=\"mfn-sblk\" data-side=\"mrifn\" data-label=\"शास्त्रि-टिप्पणी\"><details class=\"mfn-run\"><summary class=\"mfn-bar\" title=\"शास्त्रि-टिप्पणी — 1 note (1 not linked yet); click to open or fold\">टिप्पणी · 1 <span class=\"mfn-bk\">(1 ○)</span></summary><div class=\"mfn-lab\">शास्त्रि-टिप्पणी</div><div class=\"mfn-n mfn-unl\" data-mfnid=\"mfn-Aitareya-intro-1274-1\"><span class=\"mfn-ka\" title=\"Mahesh Research Institute edition (S. Subrahmanya Sh