=\"mrifn\">विषयीकृत्य</span> <span class=\"w mfn-w\" data-g=\"mrifn\"><span class=\"bhsj\">ब्रह्मसूत्रतृतीयाध्यायतृतीयपादे</span><span class=\"bhsp\">ब्रह्मसूत्र-तृतीय-अध्याय-तृतीय-पादे</span></span> <a class=\"cite lk quote lq\" href=\"reading-bs-3.html?hl=%E0%A4%86%E0%A4%A4%E0%A5%8D%E0%A4%AE%E0%A4%97%E0%A5%83%E0%A4%B9%E0%A5%80%E0%A4%A4%E0%A4%BF%E0%A4%B0%E0%A4%BF%E0%A4%A4%E0%A4%B0%E0%A4%B5%E0%A4%A6%E0%A5%81%E0%A4%A4%E0%A5%8D%E0%A4%A4%E0%A4%B0%E0%A4%BE%E0%A4%A4%E0%A5%8D&hv=1#v-3.3.16\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">“<span class=\"w mfn-w\" data-g=\"mrifn\"><span class=\"bhsj\">आत्मगृहीतिरितरवदुत्तरात्</span><span class=\"bhsp\">आत्म-गृहीतिः इतरवत् उत्तरात्</span></span>”</a> <span class=\"w mfn-w\" data-g=\"mrifn\"><span class=\"bhsj\">इत्यधिकरणे</span><span class=\"bhsp\">इति अधिकरणे</span></span> <span class=\"w mfn-w\" data-g=\"mrifn\">विचारितम्</span> । “<span class=\"w mfn-w\" data-g=\"mrifn\">आत्मा</span> <span class=\"w mfn-w\" data-g=\"mrifn\">वा</span> <span class=\"w mfn-w\" data-g=\"mrifn\"><span class=\"bhsj\">इदमेक</span><span class=\"bhsp\">इदम् एक</span></span> <span class=\"w mfn-w\" data-g=\"mrifn\">एव</span> <span class=\"w mfn-w\" data-g=\"mrifn\">अग्र</span> <span class=\"w mfn-w\" data-g=\"mrifn\"><span class=\"bhsj\">आसीदि</span><span class=\"bhsp\">आसीत् इ</span></span>” <span class=\"w mfn-w\" data-g=\"mrifn\">त्यत्र</span> <span class=\"w mfn-w\" data-g=\"mrifn\">न</span> <span class=\"w mfn-w\" data-g=\"mrifn\">परमात्मा</span> <span class=\"w mfn-w\" data-g=\"mrifn\">ग्राह्यः</span>, <span class=\"w mfn-w\" data-g=\"mrifn\">अपि</span> <span class=\"w mfn-w\" data-g=\"mrifn\">तु</span> <span class=\"w mfn-w\" data-g=\"mrifn\"><span class=\"bhsj\">हिरण्यगर्भो</span><span class=\"bhsp\">हिरण्य-गर्भः</span></span> <span class=\"w mfn-w\" data-g=\"mrifn\"><span class=\"bhsj\">ग्राह्यो</span><span class=\"bhsp\">ग्राह्यः</span></span> <span class=\"w mfn-w\" data-g=\"mrifn\"><span class=\"bhsj\">वाक्यान्वयदर्शनात्</span><span class=\"bhsp\">वाक्य-अन्वय-दर्शनात्</span></span> । <span class=\"w mfn-w\" data-g=\"mrifn\"><span class=\"bhsj\">लोकसृष्टिवचनम्</span><span class=\"bhsp\">लोक-सृष्टि-वचनम्</span></span> “<span class=\"w mfn-w\" data-g=\"mrifn\">इमान्</span> <span class=\"w mfn-w\" data-g=\"mrifn\"><span class=\"bhsj\">लोकानसृजत</span><span class=\"bhsp\">लोकान् असृजत</span></span>” <span class=\"w mfn-w\" data-g=\"mrifn\"><span class=\"bhsj\">इत्युक्तहिरण्यगर्भस्यैव</span><span class=\"bhsp\">इति उक्त-हिरण्यगर्भस्य एव</span></span> <span class=\"w mfn-w\" data-g=\"mrifn\"><span class=\"bhsj\">अन्यत्रोपनिषत्सु</span><span class=\"bhsp\">अन्यत्र उपनिषत्सु</span></span> <span class=\"w mfn-w\" data-g=\"mrifn\">दृश्यते</span>, <span class=\"w mfn-w\" data-g=\"mrifn\">यथा</span> <span class=\"w mfn-w\" data-g=\"mrifn\">बृहदारण्यके</span> <a class=\"cite lk quote lq\" href=\"reading-brha-1.html?hl=%E0%A4%86%E0%A4%A4%E0%A5%8D%E0%A4%AE%E0%A5%88%E0%A4%B5%E0%A5%87%E0%A4%A6%E0%A4%AE%E0%A4%97%E0%A5%8D%E0%A4%B0%20%E0%A4%86%E0%A4%B8%E0%A5%80%E0%A4%A4%E0%A5%8D%20%E0%A4%AA%E0%A5%81%E0%A4%B0%E0%A5%81%E0%A4%B7%E0%A4%B5%E0%A4%BF%E0%A4%A7&hv=1#v-1.4.1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">“<span class=\"w mfn-w\" data-g=\"mrifn\"><span class=\"bhsj\">आत्मैवेदमग्र</span><span class=\"bhsp\">आत्मा एव इदम् अग्रे</span></span> <span class=\"w mfn-w\" data-g=\"mrifn\">आसीत्</span> <span class=\"w mfn-w\" data-g=\"mrifn\"><span class=\"bhsj\">पुरुषविध</span><span class=\"bhsp\">पुरुष-विधः</span></span>”</a> <span class=\"w mfn-w\" data-g=\"mrifn\"><span class=\"bhsj\">इत्यत्र</span><span class=\"bhsp\">इति अत्र</span></span> । <span class=\"w mfn-w\" data-g=\"mrifn\"><span class=\"bhsj\">अत्रैव</span><span class=\"bhsp\">अत्र एव</span></span> <span class=\"w mfn-w\" data-g=\"mrifn\">पूर्वम्</span> “<span class=\"w mfn-w\" data-g=\"mrifn\"><span class=\"bhsj\">अथातो</span><span class=\"bhsp\">अथ अतः</span></span> <span class=\"w mfn-w\" data-g=\"mrifn\">रेतसः</span> <span class=\"w mfn-w\" data-g=\"mrifn\">सृष्टिः</span> <span class=\"w mfn-w\" data-g=\"mrifn\">प्रजापते</span> <span class=\"w mfn-w\" data-g=\"mrifn\"><span class=\"bhsj\">रेतो</span><span class=\"bhsp\">रेतः</span></span> <span class=\"w mfn-w\" data-g=\"mrifn\"><span class=\"bhsj\">देवा</span><span class=\"bhsp\">देवाः</span></span>” <span class=\"w mfn-w\" data-g=\"mrifn\">इति</span> । <span class=\"w mfn-w\" data-g=\"mrifn\">यत्र</span> <span class=\"w mfn-w\" data-g=\"mrifn\"><span class=\"bhsj\">पञ्चभूतसृष्टिरुच्यते</span><span class=\"bhsp\">पञ्च-भूत-सृष्टिः उच्यते</span></span> <span class=\"w mfn-w\" data-g=\"mrifn\"><span class=\"bhsj\">तत्रात्मा</span><span class=\"bhsp\">तत्र आत्मा</span></span> <span class=\"w mfn-w\" data-g=\"mrifn\"><span class=\"bhsj\">ब्रह्मैव</span><span class=\"bhsp\">ब्रह्म एव</span></span> <span class=\"w mfn-w\" data-g=\"mrifn\">यथा</span> <span class=\"w mfn-w\" data-g=\"mrifn\">तैत्तिरीयके</span> “<span class=\"w mfn-w\" data-g=\"mrifn\"><span class=\"bhsj\">आत्मन</span><span class=\"bhsp\">आत्मनः</span></span> <span class=\"w mfn-w\" data-g=\"mrifn\">आकाशः</span> <span class=\"w mfn-w\" data-g=\"mrifn\">सम्भूत</span>” <span class=\"w mfn-w\" data-g=\"mrifn\">इति</span> । <span class=\"w mfn-w\" data-g=\"mrifn\">इति</span> <span class=\"w mfn-w\" data-g=\"mrifn\"><span class=\"bhsj\">पूर्वपक्षः</span><span class=\"bhsp\">पूर्व-पक्षः</span></span> । <span class=\"w mfn-w\" data-g=\"mrifn\"><span class=\"bhsj\">सिद्धान्तस्तु</span><span class=\"bhsp\">सिद्धान्तः तु</span></span> <span class=\"w mfn-w\" data-g=\"mrifn\"><span class=\"bhsj\">परमात्मैवेह</span><span class=\"bhsp\">परम-आत्मा एव इह</span></span> <span class=\"w mfn-w\" data-g=\"mrifn\">ग्राह्यः</span> <span class=\"w mfn-w\" data-g=\"mrifn\"><span class=\"bhsj\">प्रागुत्पत्तेः</span><span class=\"bhsp\">प्राक् उत्पत्तेः</span></span> <span class=\"w mfn-w\" data-g=\"mrifn\">आत्मनः</span> <span class=\"w mfn-w\" data-g=\"mrifn\"><span class=\"bhsj\">एकत्वावधारणात्</span><span class=\"bhsp\">एकत्व-अवधारणात्</span></span> 