 mfn-w\" data-g=\"mrifn\">वा</span> <span class=\"w mfn-w\" data-g=\"mrifn\"><span class=\"bhsj\">इदमेक</span><span class=\"bhsp\">इदम् एक</span></span> <span class=\"w mfn-w\" data-g=\"mrifn\">एव</span> <span class=\"w mfn-w\" data-g=\"mrifn\">अग्र</span> <span class=\"w mfn-w\" data-g=\"mrifn\"><span class=\"bhsj\">आसीदि</span><span class=\"bhsp\">आसीत् इ</span></span>” <span class=\"w mfn-w\" data-g=\"mrifn\">त्यत्र</span> <span class=\"w mfn-w\" data-g=\"mrifn\">न</span> <span class=\"w mfn-w\" data-g=\"mrifn\">परमात्मा</span> <span class=\"w mfn-w\" data-g=\"mrifn\">ग्राह्यः</span>, <span class=\"w mfn-w\" data-g=\"mrifn\">अपि</span> <span class=\"w mfn-w\" data-g=\"mrifn\">तु</span> <span class=\"w mfn-w\" data-g=\"mrifn\"><span class=\"bhsj\">हिरण्यगर्भो</span><span class=\"bhsp\">हिरण्य-गर्भः</span></span> <span class=\"w mfn-w\" data-g=\"mrifn\"><span class=\"bhsj\">ग्राह्यो</span><span class=\"bhsp\">ग्राह्यः</span></span> <span class=\"w mfn-w\" data-g=\"mrifn\"><span class=\"bhsj\">वाक्यान्वयदर्शनात्</span><span class=\"bhsp\">वाक्य-अन्वय-दर्शनात्</span></span> । <span class=\"w mfn-w\" data-g=\"mrifn\"><span class=\"bhsj\">लोकसृष्टिवचनम्</span><span class=\"bhsp\">लोक-सृष्टि-वचनम्</span></span> “<span class=\"w mfn-w\" data-g=\"mrifn\">इमान्</span> <span class=\"w mfn-w\" data-g=\"mrifn\"><span class=\"bhsj\">लोकानसृजत</span><span class=\"bhsp\">लोकान् असृजत</span></span>” <span class=\"w mfn-w\" data-g=\"mrifn\"><span class=\"bhsj\">इत्युक्तहिरण्यगर्भस्यैव</span><span class=\"bhsp\">इति उक्त-हिरण्यगर्भस्य एव</span></span> <span class=\"w mfn-w\" data-g=\"mrifn\"><span class=\"bhsj\">अन्यत्रोपनिषत्सु</span><span class=\"bhsp\">अन्यत्र उपनिषत्सु</span></span> <span class=\"w mfn-w\" data-g=\"mrifn\">दृश्यते</span>, <span class=\"w mfn-w\" data-g=\"mrifn\">यथा</span> <span class=\"w mfn-w\" data-g=\"mrifn\">बृहदारण्यके</span> <a class=\"cite lk quote lq\" href=\"reading-brha-1.html?hl=%E0%A4%86%E0%A4%A4%E0%A5%8D%E0%A4%AE%E0%A5%88%E0%A4%B5%E0%A5%87%E0%A4%A